1NyWwf8Y%2Bk%2BZ91222YhKtP4eRc2iSrBtdi8Klg5L6bGK5Ox6zS7SSzXHOK51I9zS7lEUSSZqNcRaUhHsj3lEWT3Ro8akZv3gM9E2mYrSmVLTnumclbVl9ZPigDN3WPvHKXGzMYnOtH2WaceynjRurdr56efbd4z2%2BWe334%2B2%2FRe1nxnY\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/0-ide2-816x535.png\" alt=\"WebChucK & WebChucK IDE\"></a>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style pt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n                    Image Description</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg' : !fullWidth, 'col-lg-4' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth >= 6, 'col-lg-6' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth <= 5}\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>WebChucK &amp; WebChucK IDE (2018-present)</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><b>\n                        WebChucK</b> is ChucK running in web browsers, allowing any webpage to run ChucK code in real-time. Built using WebChucK, <b>WebChucK IDE</b>&nbsp;is an integrated development environment for ChucK that run entirely in the web browser, without needing to install ChucK or any other components. Running as WebAssembly, this runs on all modern web browsers, including Chrome, Safari, FireFox, and on mobile devices. WebChucK is able to load chugins (ChucK plugins) and, more recently, supports ChuGL's high-performance graphic capabilities.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vdY1xJAvJ6",
