        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>circle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#22a5e5\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Additional ChucK Initiatives (2016-present)</h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><b>ChuMP (2024-present) </b>The ChucK Package Manager installs, upgrades, configures, and manages ChucK modules (libraries, Chugins, etc.). We (somehow) published <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~ge/publish/files/2025-nime-chump.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">a NIME paper on ChuMP</a> that simultaneously serves as a paper about a package manager and as a cultural critique on the value of buildings tools that \"everyone wanted but no one wanted to build.\" <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~ge/publish/files/2025-nime-chump.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">paper</a> | <a href=\"https://chuck.stanford.edu/chump/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">website</a> | <a href=\"https://chuck.stanford.edu/release/chump/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">packages</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/ccrma/chump\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">source code</a></li>\n                        <li><b>ChAI (2023-present)&nbsp;</b>ChAI (ChucK for AI) provides a set of real-time friendly interactive (not generative) AI and machine learning tools for the ChucK language including multilayer perceptions, hidden markov models, support vector machines, k-nearest neighbor, as well as vectorized words and Rebecca Fiebrink's Wekinator. ChAI has been used in instrument design, live coding, and my Music and AI critical making course at Stanford.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~ge/publish/files/2024-nime-chai.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">paper</a> | <a href=\"https://chuck.stanford.edu/chai/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">website</a></li>\n                        <li><b>ChucK Language Hybrids (2016-present)</b> While we are focused on developing ChucK as an expressive tool, we recognize the beauty of having many tools, each of which embodying its own ways of thinking and doing. In addition to Chunity, here are some active hybridization between ChucK and other languages and systems. <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~rmichon/fauck/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>FaucK</b></a> (FAUST in ChucK) | <a href=\"https://github.com/ccrma/chunreal\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chunreal</b></a> (ChucK in Unreal Engine) | <a href=\"https://github.com/DBraun/ChucKDesigner\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>ChucKDesigner</b></a> (ChucK in TouchDesigner) | <a href=\"https://github.com/shakfu/numchuck\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>NumChucK</b></a> (ChucK in Python) | <a href=\"https://github.com/shakfu/chuck-max\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>chuck~</b></a> (ChucK in Max/MSP and Pure Data) | <a href=\"https://library.vcvrack.com/Chrysalis/Chrysalis\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chrysalis</b></a> (ChucK module in VCVRack)</li><li><b>ChucK Department of Education (2025-present)</b>&nbsp;There are so many simultaneous research and development efforts in flight that we have created an internal \"department\" to prioritize&nbsp;<u>d</u>ocumentation, <u>o</u>utreach, and <u>e</u>ducation (DOE or the ChucK \"department of education\"). <a href=\"https://chuck.stanford.edu/doe/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">website</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vfYkNFMx7Z",
          "_anchor": "content8-2v",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
