          "_name": "image4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image4\" group=\"Images & Videos\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDescription\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/2022-furies-1-1256x707.jpg\" alt=\"The Furies: A Laptopera\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"image-caption\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                        The laptopera was crafted specifically for the medium of the laptop orchestra, and featured custom instruments and live computer visuals. Pictured is The Rope, a shared physical instrument to be played by a group of performers, each of whom must account for their own (inter)actions as well as of those around them—embodying a fundamental duality of being an individual within a community.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/2022-furies-1256x707.jpg\" alt=\"The Furies: A Laptopera\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"image-caption\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                        The Furies: A Laptopera&nbsp;explores themes of guilt, shame, community, cycles of violence in a laptop orchestra-mediated retelling of Electra.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vgw452k1BJ",
          "_anchor": "image4-3i",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>\n                    From inception to World Premiere.</b>&nbsp;The Furies began as collaboration in 2017 between composer and PLOrk veteran Dr. Anne Hege and SLOrk to explore and create a laptop orchestra-based opera. Dr. Hege composed the music and wrote the libretto, while a team designed and built the instruments using ChucK and Wekinator. The production spanned five years and two different casts, due to the COVID-19 pandemic (which unfortunately further laid bare the many cycles of violence we perpetuate upon one another). COVID led to the final act of the opera being completely reconceived: away from redemption through divine intervention by the god Apollo, towards a humanistic contemplation on community and compassion that is far more open-ended in its interpretation. I co-produced the laptopera and also created the live visuals.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vgw4gdv6Zm",
          "_anchor": "content5-3j",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
